@startuml
' Component diagram of the VoterSystem solution
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam dpi 120

' ==================== COMPONENTS ====================
package "VoterSystem" {

  [VoterSystem.DataAccess] as DataAccess
  [VoterSystem.Shared]      as Shared
  [VoterSystem.WebAPI]      as WebAPI
  [VoterSystem.SignalR]     as SignalR
  [VoterSystem.Shared.Blazor] as SharedBlazor
  [VoterSystem.Web]         as Web
  [VoterSystem.Web.Admin]   as WebAdmin

}

' ==================== DEPENDENCIES ====================
DataAccess  --> Shared        : uses

Shared      <-- WebAPI        : uses
DataAccess  <-- WebAPI        : uses
WebAPI      --> SignalR       : uses
SignalR     --> Shared        : uses

SharedBlazor --> Shared       : uses

Web     --> SharedBlazor      : includes
WebAdmin --> SharedBlazor     : includes

' HTTP‑only (looser) dependencies
Web     ..> WebAPI : <<HTTP>> calls
WebAdmin ..> WebAPI : <<HTTP>> calls

@enduml